  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mapping UK AI Applications in Crop Trait Selection and Gene Editing (CABI)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A project to map expertise relevant to addressing global agricultural challenges, with a particular focus on relevance to sub-Saharan Africa. Using bibliometric analysis, webcrawl and interviews, conducting a mapping of UK based organisations applying AI to support trait selection for crop breeding, with a particular interest in multiplex gene editing. Within scope are applications of AI which directly contribute to breeding and gene editing optimisation.</narrative>
  </description>
